#: .\templates\authors\index.html:43
msgid "Bachelor's and Master in Biomedical Sciences"
msgstr "Licenciatura y Maestría en Ciencias Biomédicas"

#: .\templates\authors\index.html:44
msgid ""
"Mainly interested in bioinformatics, neurodegenerative diseases and genetics "
"with a growing interest in programming linked to biology and medicine."
msgstr ""
"Principalmente interesado en bioinformática, enfermedades neurodegenerativas "
"y genéticacon un interés creciente en programación ligada a la biología y la "
"medicina."

#: .\templates\authors\index.html:57
msgid "Mentor"
msgstr "Mentor"

#: .\templates\authors\index.html:58
msgid ""
"Assistant Professor of the Faculty of Medicine and Biomedical Sciences, and "
"both Director and Principal Investigator of the Algarve Biomedical Center "
"Research Institute, University of Algarve."
msgstr ""
"Profesor Asistente de la Facultad de Medicina y Ciencias Biomédicas, y "
"Director e Investigador Principal del Centro Biomédico del Algarve -"
"Instituto de Investigación de la Universidad del Algarve."

#: .\templates\authors\index.html:59
msgid ""
"Main research interests are gene therapy for rare diseases, especially those "
"affecting the nervous system."
msgstr ""
"Los principales intereses de investigación son la terapia génica para "
"enfermedades raras, especialmente aquellasque afectan el sistema nervioso."

#: .\templates\authors\index.html:75
msgid "Co-Mentor"
msgstr "Co-Mentor"

#: .\templates\authors\index.html:76
msgid ""
"Invited Assistant Professor of the Faculty of Medicine and Biomedical "
"Sciences, and post-doctoral researcher at the Algarve Biomedical Center "
"Research Institute, University of Algarve."
msgstr ""
"Profesor Asistente Invitado de la Facultad de Medicina y Ciencias Biomédicas "
"e investigador postdoctoral en el Centro Biomédico del Algarve -Instituto de "
"Investigación de la Universidad del Algarve."

#: .\templates\authors\index.html:77
msgid ""
"Carlos' research is focused on the molecular mechanisms underlying "
"hereditary disorders of the nervous system, especially polyglutamine "
"diseases."
msgstr ""
"Su investigaciónse centra en los mecanismos moleculares que subyacen a "
"trastornos hereditarios del sistema nervioso, especialmente enfermedades "
"poliglutamina"

